BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Main-Dempster Mile: Earth Day Neighborhood CleanUp
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T110000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T130000
UID:4d79889bcae5cecf79819e2b6e542583@cityofevanston.org
DESCRIPTION:<p data-start="0" data-end="579">Celebrate Earth Day by partic
 ipating in the Main Dempster Mile Earth Day Cleanup on Saturday\, April 18
 \, from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m. Volunteers can check in anytime during the event
  at one of two locations: Hive Center for the Book Arts\, 840 Custer Ave. 
 for the Main Street area\, or Windfree Solar Cafe\, 517 Dempster St. for t
 he Dempster Street area. Cleanup supplies\, including trash bags\, gloves 
 (with a limited number of children&rsquo\;s sizes available)\, and route m
 aps for individuals and groups\, will be provided. <a href="https://forms.
 gle/n9pKvH3EoHXLSAue7" target="_blank">Sign up to participate</a>.&nbsp\;<
 /p>
LOCATION:Main-Dempster Mile
URL:https://www.maindempstermile.com/mdm-event-calendar
X-SOURCE:City of Evanston
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Evanston Earth Day Clean-Up
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260426T120000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260426T140000
UID:bd7fb3e62f9b17cd976b6a36221ec0df@cityofevanston.org
DESCRIPTION:<span style="font-weight: 400\;">Join Downtown Evanston\, The 
 Woman&rsquo\;s Club of Evanston\, and Brightview Landscaping for a communi
 ty clean-up in the downtown business district. Volunteers will meet at the
  north side of Fountain Square to pick up supplies before heading out to c
 ollect litter along assigned routes. Pre-registered participants will be e
 ntered to win a $100 Evanston e-gift card.</span>
LOCATION:Downtown Evanston
URL:https://downtownevanston.org/earthdaycleanup
X-SOURCE:City of Evanston
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
